# NAB international transaction fee — GST FREE

## Confirmed (SELPIC)

`Nab Intnl Tran Fee` (e.g. **$1.53** on **26/03/2026**, category **Bank Fees & Interest**):

- **P&L**: yes — company bank fee expense (`EXPENSE_BANK_FEES_INTEREST`)
- **BAS 1B / gstClaimable**: **no** — GST-free / not an AU taxable supply to claim
- Manual GST-free overrides must survive refresh (`gstInfo.reasoning` starts with `Manual:`)

## Implementation

- Auto tag: `lib/gst/apply-known-purchase-gst.ts` (`GST_FREE_BANK_FEE_PATTERNS`)
- Upload path: `buildGstInfoForRules` in `lib/ai-classifier/rule-based-classifier.ts`
- Manual edit persist: patch **every** History statement that holds the row (not only `currentStatementId`)

## Do not

- Treat GST-free as “exclude from expenses” — fee still hits Real-Time P&L costs
- Overwrite `Manual:` gstInfo on load
- Persist GST edits only when a statement was Load-ed first
